      "body": "Stir the flour, water, salt and yeast into a very sticky, rough dough (stand mixer: beater, medium, 30–60 s). Weigh the flour. The ratio matters."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Cover. Rise at room temp for 2 h."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Refrigerate at least 2 h, up to 7 days. It rises, then falls. That’s normal. The longer it chills, the tangier it gets."
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
      "name": "Bake day"
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Dust the top of the dough with flour. With greased hands, turn out <strong>all</strong> of it onto a floured surface and round into a ball. Don’t fuss."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Set on parchment or a greased sheet pan. Sift a light coat of flour over the top. Cover loosely with greased plastic. Rise until it relaxes and spreads, ≈90 min (up to 2 h if the kitchen is cool)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "During the rise, preheat oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">450 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(232 °C)</span></span> with the stone on the middle rack and a metal pan (not glass) on the lowest rack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Slash the top 2–3 times, ½ in deep."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [
        {
          "name": "Water, hot",
          "g": 240,
          "vol": "1 cup",
          "note": null,
          "kcal": null,
          "na": null,
          "pro": null,
          "counted": null,
          "countedNote": null,
          "key": "Water, hot"
        }
      ],
      "body": "Load the bread. Pour the hot water into the pan below and close the door fast."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Bake until deep golden brown and <span class=\"rc-nw\">205–210 °F</span> internal, <span class=\"rc-nw\">≈40–45 min</span>."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Cool on a rack at least 1 h before slicing."
    }
